**This project contains only public data.** The device private key is in the
Secure Enclave and cannot be exported.
{%- if issuer_mode == "ephemeral-ca" %} The CA private key was destroyed
immediately after it signed the device certificate and was never written to
disk, so there is no `ca-private-key.pem` here and never will be.
{%- endif %}

